The mathematics formalized here is that of the paper "The Fibonacci numbers are not
3-accessible" by William J. Wesley (arXiv:2609.33744v1). The paper itself is not included.
This repository is an independent formalization and is not affiliated with or endorsed by
the paper's author.

Lean 4 and Mathlib (Apache-2.0) are fetched by Lake at build time and are not included;
their exact revisions are recorded in lake-manifest.json.
